window.products.push({"id":1059093,"name":"asobu Coldbrew Portable Cold Brew Coffee Maker With a Vacuum Insulated 34oz Stainless Steel 18/8 Carafe Bpa Free","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+VjgU2rQL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Asobu Coldbrew Portable Cold Brew Coffee Maker 40oz is first of its kind. True to its name Asobu has taken cold brew to the next level, as Asobu always will do.   Cold brew on the go a portable and vacuum insulated way to brew coffee.  Cold brew is the next generation of the typical iced coffee. Using hot water on your coffee granules creates a more acidic bitter drink while using cold water with coffee and allowing it to steep as with the Asobu cold brew creates 80% lower acidity, deeper and smoother, naturally sweet taste and also gives it that extra punch of caffeine. Not having any heat in the process also preserves antioxidants making the cold brew coffee a healthier more natural choice.  Asobu portable 2 in one cold brewer is the only brewer that doesn’t need to be refrigerator at all making it the most convenient option in the market.The brewing carafe is constructed from 100% Bpa free non-breakable tritan with a reusable and easy to clean 18/8 rust-free superfine double wall stainless steel mesh to give the purest smoothest coffee brew. The take on the go 40oz mug is made with copper double walled vacuum insulation so your brew will keep cold and hot for hours. Our brewer and mug is compatible for hot coffee as well.  Asobu Brewer hold 6 servings so leave in the fridge for up to 2 weeks and still get that same great rich and fresh concentrate. So how does this work you ask? Simple Fill the mesh with 1.3 ounce of your standard medium course coffee granules. Pour over the coffee grinds in a circular motion cold filtered water. Do this three times. And that’s it! Your coffee will now begin steeping. Come back 12 hours later to delicious silky rich tasting coffee. Simply move the seal to open and press the release button to have your brew easily transferred from the brewer to the serving vacuum insulated stainless steel carafe. Add some ice cubes and milk or cream and voilà your coffee is ready for a full work day or a 24 hour road trip. Its 100% spill proof so no worries if you throw it into your bag or leave it on your desk with papers all over.  Asobu has created this brewer with all lifestyles in mind so take it with you on your outdoor expeditions its durable and sturdy construction will last you years and years. Tea lovers we haven’t forgotten about you! Our fine mesh works amazing with loose leaf tea as well so you too can enjoy a nice hot cup of steeped tea on the go.Still prefer that pour over hot coffee this Asobu portable brewer can have your hot coffee made in just three minutes. So forget about going all the way to a coffee shop or the like to get a rich cup of tea or coffee Asobu bring rich tasting brew right to your door.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+VjgU2rQL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"asobu","source_asin":"B079D3NTQB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1059093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079D3NTQB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079D3NTQB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1059094,"name":"Gas Logs 24pcs Gas Fireplace Logs Set of Ceramic Wood Logs.White Ceramic Pebbles Use in Fireplaces & Fire Pits","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517dNiprgtL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The Fireplace Is Really A Plus For Home! These creature comforts add an extra touch of architectural vitality to a house, inside and out. No other type of heating appliance offers the kind of cozy warmth that you can only get from a fire. Fireplaces offer a cheerful place to gather around crackling flames with family and friends, to pull up in a favorite chair and read a good book, and enjoy countless other favorite indoor activities. Each log has been carefully sculpted to perfection to imitate the true beauty of nature while availing to our eco friendly world. In order to create a more warm atmosphere, we carefully designed this fireplace log. When making it, we tried a lot of materials, and finally used this lightweight ceramic. Its main characteristics are lifelike, fire-resistant, durable, non-toxic and safe. The disadvantage is that it is easy to break. Fortunately, it won't be often stressed. therefore We also ship in a molded foam package to keep your logs safe during transit. If there is any damage or other quality problems when receiving, please contact me, we will make you satisfied, wish you a happy life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517dNiprgtL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N\\C","source_asin":"B093LP9MPF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1059094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093LP9MPF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093LP9MPF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
