window.products.push({"id":1059281,"name":"Nuwave Portable Air Purifier, H13 True HEPA & Carbon Filter, Dual 3-Stage Air Filtration, up to 1,130 Sq. Ft., Captures 99.97% of Particle, Pet Allerg","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lGgbBX0gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH PERFORMANCE AIR PURIFIER: The Portable True HEPA Air Purifier can purify large rooms, such as bedrooms, living rooms, kitchens, and basements. Purify a 403 ft² room 3x per hour and a 1,130 ft² room 1x per hour. SMART TECHNOLOGY BUILT-IN – Auto function utilizes sensors to continuously monitor air quality in the room and automatically adjusts fan speeds for optimal purification. Turbo function operates at max speed for up to 2 hours for rapid purification. 4 fan speeds can be selected for up to 12 hours. ENERGY STAR CERTIFIED – You can operate the NuWave air purifier 24 hours a day for a year for less than $10 in electricity costs! It is also FCC and ETL certified. OZONE FREE – NuWave air purifier doesn’t utilize UV-C light, which can produce harmful ozone. It is also California Air Resource Board (CARB) certified to comply with the state’s stringent testing, electrical safety, and ozone requirements. ALLERGY RELIEF – Soothe congestion, watery eyes, sneezing & other allergy symptoms by purifying the air of allergens and allergy triggers that can irritate the sinuses, nasal passages, and lungs. The H13 True HEPA removes 99.97% of airborne contaminants as small as 0.3 microns including dust, smoke & pollen. ENJOY BETTER SLEEP - The National Sleep Foundation found that sleep is dramatically impaired by allergy symptoms and worse the symptoms, the more severe the disturbances. OxyPure is designed with Sleep mode. All indicator lights turn off and fan operates at whisper-quiet level to help promote ideal sleeping conditions. TRAVEL-FRIENDLY - This sleek, lightweight clean air solution blends seamlessly into any space. It’s perfect for hotel rooms, small apartments & dorms, and it’s travel-friendly! It is compact and even fits in most carry-on bags so you can enjoy fresh air anywhere you travel. DUAL 3-STAGE FILTRATION – The combination of H13 True HEPA, carbon, and pre-filter is powerfully engineered to effectively purify the air in a 1,130 square foot room with 24 full air exchanges per day. MODERN & FUNCTIONAL DESIGN - NuWave air purifier is a powerhouse wrapped in an attractive case great for any décor. Its neutral colors will blend well with any color theme. TOUCH SCREEN CONTROLS – The LED touch screen is elegant and responsive. Easily control all 6 functions with a simple touch of the screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lGgbBX0gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nuwave","source_asin":"B0BRQBVY4R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1059281","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRQBVY4R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRQBVY4R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
