window.products.push({"id":1059361,"name":"Spice Jar Labels, Minimalist 184 Preprinted + 8 Blank Write-on Label, Dishwasher Safe & Waterproof Spice Bottles Stickers, 2.05\" x 1.25\" Spice Sticker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eUXaOqLkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Minimalist Fine Line Spice Labels - Our spice jar labels are printed in all caps large black font with high contrast for easy reading. 184 preprinted labels with commonly used spices and herbs names for organizing every space in your kitchen. Also 8 blank labels allows you to label yourslef. High Quality Material: We use environmentally friendly PET (Polyethylene terephthalate) material, which has better optical transparency and abrasion resistance than PVC. At the same time, we increased the thickness of the sticker to 0.08mm, double thicker than others. These improvements make our stickers clear and more durable, don't need to worry that the sticker will tear and turn yellow after a long time. Easy to Read - All caps large black font with high contrast for easy reading. The dimension of the spice jar labels are 2.05 Inch x 1.25 Inch that is suitable for different size spice jars. Also there is enough blank space in above and below, if needed, you can cut it to suitable size to fit small jars. Dishwasher Safe & Waterproof Spice Bottles Labels - Premium PET label, Compared with PVC material label, more suitable for kitchen use, has an adhesive that will not fall off or tear, and can be used for many years, but it can be removed and replaced as needed without damage. Similarly, spice labels with a protective film are waterproof, oil-proof and can be washed in the dishwasher. Organize Your Spice Rack - There are 184 spice labels, from Basil, Cilantro, Rosemery, Curry to Montreal Steak, Taco, Chili Powder or BBQ Seasoning . And reference sheet alphabetized list of labels, you'll find them all easily! Service Support - SATISFACTION GUARANTEE We provide you with a 100% money back guarantee if you are not completely satisfied with door mat within 12 months, and please be frankly tell us if you have any questions","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eUXaOqLkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RZDFATE","source_asin":"B08YXJ9TYL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1059361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YXJ9TYL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YXJ9TYL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
