window.products.push({"id":1059437,"name":"Antique Map Geographica by Jan Janssonius | Woven Tapestry Wall Art Hanging | Old World Cartography | 100% Cotton USA Size 45x35","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":140.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1jGAU7g+JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wall Tapestries can be fun and still make a statement in your home. Our Tapestries are a must have piece of wall art decor as they always become a conversation piece. The texture of the wall tapestry makes this art unique and creates the intrigue that captivates us to examine it more closely. This art wall hanging is woven in our family owned textile mill in the mountains of North Carolina by expert weavers who have generations of weaving experience. We select the highest quality cotton yarn, weave it on jacquard looms then we cut and sew each wall tapestry by hand.  The fabric of the tapestry creates an acoustic elegance to any room unlike the printed sheet \"tapestries\" which poorly imitate an authentic woven wall tapestry. The back of the tapestry is open so you can see how craftsmanship and weave structure creates the image on the face of the art. We use natural fibers such as cotton for each and every wall tapestry. Cotton is the most comforting natural fiber and it invites the touch of a hand...when was the last time you touched a painting. A wall tapestry is an inviting addition to your home decor. Our family was America’s first weavers, weaving blankets for our troops during the revolutionary war in our mill in Philadelphia.  We love what we do and are proud of our textile heritage. From our family to yours we make sure you are receiving a wall tapestry that will last a lifetime. Enjoy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1jGAU7g+JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fine Art Tapestries","source_asin":"B002KGGWRM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1059437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002KGGWRM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002KGGWRM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1059438,"name":"Vinyl Record Outer Sleeves - No Haze Premium Record Covers Protection 3 Mil Density (3/1000 inch) Thick 12” Protective Album Sleeves for Vinyl Records","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61503aJpO6L._AC_SL1005_.jpg","description":"Premium outer record sleeves, the right vinyl sleeve for 33 Lp's will tastefully guard your vintage collection 12.5\" x 12.7\" with a 1.5\" flap. If you are looking for great Vinyl record protective sleeves, look no further Reliable and sturdy old school durability record outer sleeves, keep your vinyl covers in great shape, Polypropylene vinyl cover sleeves (BOPP) ensures crystal clear high shine album protection All around outer sleeves vinyl protection, resealable poly adhesive flaps completely encloses the album cover to keep your vinyl albums always protected and dust free. No Haze plastic record sleeves jacket protectors Preferred Heavy duty vinyl sleeves for audiophiles and serious collectors, eliminates wear and tear of your cover bags keeping your precious record collection safe and looking nice and neat Our customers are our number One Priority! We are confident you are going to love your new vinyl record sleeves we back them up with a no questions asked satisfaction guarantee. Vinyl album sleeves always make a great gift for any serious audiophile or vinyl music enthusiast","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61503aJpO6L._AC_SL1005_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Record-Happy","source_asin":"B076H1Y18S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1059438","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076H1Y18S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076H1Y18S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1059439,"name":"FridgeBoost Odor Deodorizer with Zeolite and Activated Charcoal - Odor Absorber, Refrigerator Smell Eliminator, Charcoal Activated Moisture Eliminator","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hZwwqW7-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEP FOOD FRESH LONGER: If you love fruits and veggies as we do, this is the accessory you want to have in your fridge! Extend the shelf life of all foods inside your fridge, especially fruits and veggies, with our Fridgeboost odor deodorizer. HELPS REDUCE ODOR: Pungent foods and unseen spills can produce unwanted odors in your refrigerator and freezer. FridgeBoost odor eliminator regulates humidity, reduces temperatures, and absorbs ethylene gases to eliminate odors while keeping your fruit, vegetables, and perishable goods fresher for up to 3 times longer. Say goodbye to the unpleasant smell! SAVES YOU MONEY: We buy food to prepare tasty, nutritious meals, but instead, we toss it out to the garbage because it goes bad, which is a waste of money. Stabilizing your refrigerator's temperature and moisture levels are made easier with our refrigerator odor and produce saver. EASY TO USE: Place it on the top shelf of your fridge towards the back to eliminate unpleasant odors. We combine our product with natural minerals to produce the perfect environment in your refrigerator for ion exchange, water, and gas absorption. SAFE AND EFFECTIVE: Our odor eliminator for strong odor has activated charcoal and innovative mineral technology manufactured from a natural patented zeolite formula. Every ingredient of this refrigerator smell eliminator is derived from domestic sources and produced entirely within the United States.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hZwwqW7-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Clean+Green","source_asin":"B091BDS6B6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1059439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091BDS6B6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091BDS6B6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
