window.products.push({"id":1059500,"name":"Bkkack Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, 100 Pcs Air Fryer Liners, Non-stick Parchment Paper for Frying, Baking, Cooking, Roasting and Microwave - Unb","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kTOOBBZCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅[NO MORE STRESS CLEANING BASKET]: Using parchment paper to line air fryer will be a total game changer if you find it’s a hassle to clean all the oil, grill tray and cumbersome basket after each cooking. The liner holds oil from the food, glaze and sauce that would normally drip off and burn onto the pot, just simply rest the paper on the tray and all the clean will be a breeze. ✅[120 PCS 6.3” PRE-CUT SIZE] : Each liner figures a bowl shape with 6.3” in bottom width and 2” in edge height. PLEASE MEASURE YOUR AIR FRYER BASKET BOTTOM BEFORE PURCHASE! 120 pieces in one pack are enough for a long time daily uses. ✅[UNBLEACHED NATURAL PARCHMENT]: Liners are made of food-grade natural wood pulp. Unbleached paper is totally fluorescent-free. 45gsm thickness is thicker than ordinary parchment to be durable and sturdy, and won’t tear when lifting even after cooking. It stands high temperatures up to 428℉(To prevent the Paper liner from burned, please do not heat the air fryer with no food on it!). It can also be used in frying pan, microwave oven, oven and insta-pot. ✅[NON-STICK, WATER-OIL PROOF, CONVENIENT]: The liner has a food-grade silicone coating that makes it waterproof and oil-resistant, the food will not stick to the liner surface and be damaged even though with rich sauce on. The paper doesn't insulate hot air flow like the silicone does. Take one piece and put it in the basket. After use, take it out and discard it. No cutting or measuring is required, easy and convenient. ✅[GENERAL-PURPOSE]: Perfect for meat, fish, French fries, chips, chicken wings and thighs, chicken tenders, rib eye steak, steak bites, sweet potatoes, tater tots, carrot fries, meatballs, butterfly shrimp, zucchini fries, vegetables, broccoli, fajitas, dessert, cinnamon apples, blooming onion, char siu, pizza rolls and sausage links with air fryer, instant vortex air fryer, chefman air fryer and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kTOOBBZCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bkkack","source_asin":"B09QS16BY7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1059500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QS16BY7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QS16BY7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
