window.products.push({"id":1059837,"name":"Depuley Portable Table Fan and LED Light, 8\" Battery Operated Personal Desk Fan for Hanging or Tabletop Use, 4000mAH Outdoor Small Rechargeable Quiet ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e-K0wOJjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Portable & 4000mAH Rechargeable Battery】Depuley personal fan can be powered by battery or USB. As a battery operated fan, it can work 4-8 hours at different speeds so it's convenient for you to carry outdoors with no need to worry about charging it. As a USB powered fan, you can charge it with an adapter, power bank and so on. It only takes 4 hours to be fully charged. This rechargeable fan only weighs 0.83lbs, and has a bracket design not only for hanging but can also be handheld for indoor or outdoor use. 【Powerful & Quiet Airflow】Increasing airflow usually means increasing the diameter of the fan. 8inch diameter of the camping fan puts on amount of airflow and runs really quiet ( 30db at low setting). 3 speed options to meet your demands for different occasions. It works great for a cot tent, home, grilling, camping, hiking, kitchen, kids bunk bed or dorm room, etc, best mini fan for desks. 【Ultra Bright LED Light】The dimmable UL-Listed USB fan designed with 3 brightness settings LED lantern, the adjustable LED lights can switch from 50% brightness to 100% brightness to act as a table makeup fan or a camping fan for tents that will provide you with enough light when you use it. Provided a soft and non-glaring light, protect your eyesight, enhance your nighttime use. If you like outdoor travel or camping, it is ideal for reading or studying at night. 【Practical Household Fan Design】Our office fan with 5 pcs transparent ABS fan blades, white plastic lampshade and silent motor, hard and high temperature, soft and even, beautiful and durable. 6W 3 LEVES LED light and 3 speed wind, very good and very practical and cool. You can purchase it as a gift for your friends or family. 【After-Sell Service】 We firmly believe in product quality. We offer a full 12 months quality assurance, 60 days refund for quality. If you are not satisfied with our products, please feel free to contact us. Our service purpose is to satisfy customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e-K0wOJjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Depuley","source_asin":"B0BQHLHH5M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1059837","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQHLHH5M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQHLHH5M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
