window.products.push({"id":1059905,"name":"Collectable Sign and Clock GMRE1109341 Torch Red 14\" Corvette C6 Lighted Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QdwEITC1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Collectable Sign and Clock's C6 Corvette Torch Red Lighted Clock measures 14 inches across. The outer lens is made from high quality optical Lexan held in place with 3 removable rivets. It is scratch resistant and won't yellow over time. The advertisement face is cut out by a CNC router and the image is placed with a UV dried computer controlled printing process that will last for many years. The back of the clock is made from black ABS plastic that houses a 22 Watt fluorescent circline replaceable bulb with an on/off switch in the cord. The clock is a battery operated quartz movement that runs from 1 double AA battery. This would look great in your home, office, or garage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QdwEITC1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Collectable Sign and Clock","source_asin":"B006EP4PHE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1059905","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006EP4PHE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006EP4PHE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
