window.products.push({"id":1059974,"name":"Moscow Mule Copper Mug By Sirqit® - Cocktail Recipes Included - Premium Drinkware For Any Chilled Beverage - Pure 100% Solid Unlined 16 oz Hammered Cu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TeJYWTu1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Back in 1941, three prestigious friends gathered at a New York bar- Jack Morgan (President of Cock ‘n’ Bull Products and Maker of Ginger Beer), John Martin, President of Heublein Brothers, and Rudolph Kunett, President of Pierre Smirnoff, the Heublein vodka division. After a few rounds of drinks, and some spirited innovative ideas, they decided to put a shot of vodka and a squirt of lemon in a cup of ginger beer. They served it up chilled in a solid copper cup, and the Moscow Mule was born. Ever since, the copper cup has been used for the Moscow Mule, and is ideal for making your favorite perfectly chilled drinks, like beer, iced tea or coffee, and mojitos. Your mug styles are premium quality, elegant hand-hammered solid copper made for long-lasting beauty. It is designed with a large copper handle for comfort, so you'll be proud to serve your guests their favorite chilled drinks in these copper mugs. We know that you and your guests like to drink in style. This is a great gift idea for someone special for holidays and special occasions. Original Moscow Mule Recipe Makes 1 drink (Copper Mug NOT Optional) Squeeze lime juice into your new Moscow Mule Copper Mug filled with ice Pour in 2 oz of vodka Top with cold ginger beer Garnish with a lime wedge Click \"Add to Cart\" To Get Your Own Sirqit Moscow Mule Copper Mug Shipped Today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TeJYWTu1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sirqit","source_asin":"B015M3D5CO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1059974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015M3D5CO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015M3D5CO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
